      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I ran the full test suite before pushing my branch, and there are four failures (see ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/7a29c4e7c634cd738a834d523b117e85cd2c1a61)"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/7a29c4e7c634cd738a834d523b117e85cd2c1a61)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": " that all happen when testing deleting an object in unit tests.  Deleting an object in the repository works fine, so I think this is an issue with the mock objects, but I couldn't figure out why this was happening in the limited amount of time I had to work on this, so I thought it would be better to create a PR now in case it's easy for someone else to figure out.",
          "type": "text"
