     "body": "<p>I ran the full test suite before pushing my branch, and there are four failures (see <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/7a29c4e7c634cd738a834d523b117e85cd2c1a61\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/commit/7a29c4e7c634cd738a834d523b117e85cd2c1a61</a>) that all happen when testing deleting an object in unit tests.  Deleting an object in the repository works fine, so I think this is an issue with the mock objects, but I couldn't figure out why this was happening in the limited amount of time I had to work on this, so I thought it would be better to create a PR now in case it's easy for someone else to figure out.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/672\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/pull/672</a></p>",
